    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "A 500px rendering of an SVG version of a PD image already present on the Commons, <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kokopelli_1.png\" title=\"File:Kokopelli 1.png\">Kokopelli</a> - derived from the same original source, &amp; this SVG was initially uploaded to English Wikipedia under this name, &amp; replacing the deleted PNG version of the same name, &amp; the image depicts a modern neutered (no <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/phallus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:phallus\">phallus</a>) representation of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kokopelli\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Kokopelli\">Kokopelli</a>, the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hopi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Hopi\">Hopi</a> fertility <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/kachina\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:kachina\">kachina</a>, &amp; this version has been \"flipped\" so tha the kokopelli is facing left.",
